  "body": "## Summary\n\nExtract backend routes from the shared `api` repo into a standalone backend for this app. Deploy as its own K8s Deployment + Service + Ingress on AKS.\n\n## Work\n\n- Extract this app's route package from the shared API into a standalone backend (or keep the existing routes and package them as an independent container)\n- Create K8s manifests: Deployment, Service, Ingress (for `workout.romaine.life`)\n- Create ExternalSecret for app-specific secrets from Key Vault\n- Create ArgoCD Application\n- Workload identity via `infra-shared` service account for Azure resource access\n- Verify: app fully functional with valid TLS at its subdomain\n\n## Tracked by\n\nnelsong6/infra-bootstrap#24\n\n## Risk profile\n\nPersonal portfolio — no external users, SLAs, or paging. Migrate with confidence: direct cutover, no canary windows, no rollback rehearsals. If something breaks, iterate. Blast radius is zero. Don't over-engineer this.",
